147
00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:26.267
♪ Just one? (You’re good!) Dozens? (Redesign!) ♪

148
00:10:26.567 --> 00:10:35.160
(narrator) The pop quiz, an interrogation under a swinging lamp: seven cards, each with a question and an answer hidden under classified tape that slides away when the answer is called.

149
00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:40.360
♪ Pop quiz, agent! Y2K: what got copied everywhere? ♪

150
00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.660
♪ (crowd) The two-digit year! ♪

151
00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.000
♪ What should a module hide? ♪

152
00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.700
♪ (crowd) A decision likely to change! ♪

153
00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.580
