163
00:11:05.133 --> 00:11:11.952
(narrator) The final chorus: the decrypted sentence again, and the three case files with their sealed secrets behind laser walls.

164
00:11:11.952 --> 00:11:19.348
(narrator) The vault is now UserRepository: its nameplate, find by email, stays the same while its secret changes from MongoDB to Supabase.

165
00:11:19.348 --> 00:11:21.949
(narrator) Only one module changes, and fireworks bloom.

